{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）上午10時16分，香港仔石排灣道100A號發生工業意外。據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷，其中男傷者半昏迷，女傷者清醒，同送瑪麗醫院治理。警方現調查事故。</p><figure><img alt=\"男傷者半昏迷，女傷者清醒，同送瑪麗醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167286386680664064560498.jpeg/GazwWAQ0cG-oUWj8oKG4irhQxMcwn61pFajvQRWo70E\"/><figcaption>男傷者半昏迷，女傷者清醒，同送瑪麗醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:25.490228+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:48:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:41.360974+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:41.360974+00:00","content_hash":"6b88d901626aab762628ceea55d8442d659368eb001904c5d796644356b69199","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}